From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abue Ammar <14371506+abue-ammar@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:37:29 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] Add native localization for eight languages (#1620)

* Add native localization for eight languages

* Refactor volume display to respect locale settings

- Updated VolumeSlider to display volume percentage according to the current locale.
- Modified VolumeHUDView to ensure the volume percentage reflects the current locale when not muted.
- Enhanced documentation regarding the relaunch process to clarify the handling of termination and cleanup.

* Default the interface language to English

Drop the System choice: TinycastLaunch writes the stored language back
before anything is localized, so an empty or unshipped list launches in
English. Remove comments that restated the code.

* Update documentation for keyword packs to clarify localization behavior
